        </p>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:20px;">
          <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=1555+Campbell+Ln+Bowling+Green+KY+42104" style="display:inline-block;background:#2c1810;color:#b8865c;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em;">📍 Visit our showroom</a>
