            <p>Quilted fabrics, high-density foams, and breathable support cores — no corners cut.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="posh-story__col">
            <h4>Support You Can Feel</h4>
            <p>Multi-layer foam construction cradles pressure points while maintaining spinal alignment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="posh-story__col">
            <h4>Built to Last</h4>
            <p>Limited lifetime warranty reflects our confidence in every mattress we build.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

